Fireflies (반딧불이)
Copyright 2026 CLSOFTLAB (씨엘소프트랩), Dr. Lee Il-guk (이일국)

An open, gentle night-sky art project: hundreds of tiny helium sky-jellyfish
released into the air and left to drift on the wind, blinking in slow, self-
organising synchrony. Designed with Claude (Anthropic's AI). This is NOT an
Anthropic product and is not endorsed by or affiliated with Anthropic.

