Safety
------
The default operating mode is indoor or tethered (retrievable). Free wind-
release is advanced and requires permits and coordination with aviation
authorities (in Korea, the Aviation Safety Act / 항공안전법). Helium is an
asphyxiant in enclosed spaces and cylinders are high-pressure. A firefly is
not litter: released count must equal recovered count. See docs/en/03-safety-
and-airspace.md and docs/en/04-leave-no-trace.md.
